    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A high-voltage frame-mounted stun emitter that delivers a full nervous system override on contact, briefly overwhelming the target's ability to take voluntary action. The system includes a charge capacitor that can sustain multiple discharges per engagement without drawing from the weapon's heat sink. Developed by Alliance Intelligence for close-quarters capture operations. Designed for pistols. When you Strike with a pistol as a melee weapon and hit, the target is stunned 1.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a pistol.</p>"
